MISSING is not better than RED: it means the commit was never judged — and it is now only said when
every workflow run on this tip is terminal, so it is never merely 'too early to tell'. Queued main runs collapse
to one (cloud.yml concurrency), so a tip with no verdict is a tip nobody measured.
This is a LEVEL check. It reds on every run until the tip carries a green verdict on every
watched context — re-run the workflow on this sha, or land the fix that makes it green.
